  "claim": "The film Mad Hot Ballroom starring Grayson Cobb was created more recently as compared to the 1982 film for which \"Powaqqatsi\" is a sequel.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Koyaanisqatsi. Sentence: Koyaanisqatsi ( ), also known as Koyaanisqatsi: Life Out of Balance, is a 1982 American experimental film directed by Godfrey Reggio with music composed by Philip Glass and cinematography by Ron Fricke.\nPage: Mad Hot Ballroom. Sentence: Mad Hot Ballroom is a 2005 American documentary film directed and co-produced by Marilyn Agrelo and written and co-produced by Amy Sewell, about a ballroom dance program in the New York City Department of Education, the New York City public school system for fifth graders.\nPage: Powaqqatsi. Sentence: Powaqqatsi ( ), or Powaqqatsi: Life in Transformation, is a 1988 American documentary film directed by Godfrey Reggio and the sequel to Reggio's experimental 1982 film, \"Koyaanisqatsi\".",
